@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Microsoft button appears only when Authentication:Sso:Enabled is true.
GET {{baseUrl}}/login

### Returns a Microsoft authorization redirect with code + PKCE, state and nonce.
### Complete this in a browser; keep the correlation/nonce cookies.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/sso/login?returnUrl=%2Flearner

### An external return URL is ignored; success returns to the local root.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/sso/login?returnUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.invalid

### Forged callback must not create an LMS authentication session.
GET {{baseUrl}}/signin-oidc?code=invalid&state=invalid

### Disabled configuration: the challenge route is not mapped (404).
# GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/sso/login

### Google button is independently gated by Authentication:Google:Enabled.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/login?returnUrl=%2Flearner

### Forged Google callback must not issue an LMS authentication cookie.
GET {{baseUrl}}/signin-google?code=invalid&state=invalid
